# shellcheck shell=bash
# Invocation behind output/evaluation/der_concat/ (the earlier
# utterance-concatenation arrangement, kept for comparison).
#
# Job 8976357 (au_der_concat), 2026-10-04, account educ-lift, an NVIDIA
# L40S on htc-g066, from the clone ~/paper_speech_transcription_audit_w2 at
# code 9cb43e3 with a clean tree, as its environment record and the
# summary's run_metadata say. The record, environment/au_der_concat_8976357.txt
# beside the original's results on ARC, gives the effective parameters
# SPLIT=test, MIX_MODE=concat,
# CACHE_DIR=${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/audit2026/der/cache_concat
# and EXTRA_ARGS=--utterances-per-meeting 25. That cache directory was new,
# so the job built its meetings from the stream (its log,
# logs/benchmark_der_8976357.out in that clone, has no "reading N
# reconstructed meetings" line) into test_concat_25utt/ there and, since
# 2bb4224, scored them as written to 16-bit WAV (audit finding EDER-06).
# The log also shows the preflight passing with --diarisation-required.
#
# Job 8534773 (2026-08-10, htc-g072, code not recorded) ran these settings
# first and scored the unquantised mix; its files are in git at aaffb81.
# Every figure of the two runs agrees to six decimals, and the report is
# the same file.
#
# CACHE_DIR below sends a reproduction's corpus to a new directory under
# repro/ as well, so that it too builds the meetings it scores and writes
# nothing into ${DATA}/ami_cache, which holds only the timeline caches. The
# other variables the script turns into arguments are set empty: sbatch
# passes the submitting shell's variables through, and a value left there
# would otherwise reach the job.
#
# Reproduce (from the repository root on ARC), on the card type the
# original ran on:
#   ( set -a; . hpc/runs/der_concat.env || exit 1; set +a
#     sbatch --account=educ-lift --gres=gpu:l40s:1 hpc/submit_benchmark_der.sh )
#
# A reproduction writes to its own directory under repro/, so it cannot
# overwrite the ARC copy of the original run it is to be compared with.
# original: REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/audit2026/der/der_concat"
# original: CACHE_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/audit2026/der/cache_concat"
SPLIT=test
MIX_MODE=concat
CACHE_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/repro/cache_concat"
LIMIT_MEETINGS=
MAX_MINUTES=
UTT_PER_MEETING=25
CLUSTERING_THRESHOLD=
MIN_CLUSTER_SIZE=
MIN_DURATION_OFF=
SEGMENTATION_MODEL=
ORACLE_NUM_SPEAKERS=
REPORT_DIR="${DATA}/speech_transcription_env/output/evaluation/repro/der_concat"
